    {
      "text": "Do you like your subject?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 1.37
    },
    {
      "text": "I enjoy my subjects because they were my deliberate choice, not something the school imposed on me. And AI-assisted coding is empowering — it means anyone, not just computer science students, can create a real app or a real website using natural language, using English. That's impressive. English is also one of my favorite things — I can use it to explore the world and communicate with people from different countries, to access their culture. That's very interesting to me.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 1.81,
      "end": 28.0
    }
